"<p>Unique name of the <b>Useraction</b>. It is only used in the "
"<i>Konfigurator</i> and doesn't appear in any other menu.</p><p><b>Note</b>: "
"The <i>Title</i> shown in the <b>Usermenu</b> can be set below.</p>"
msgstr ""
