#: krusader/krslots.cpp:189
msgid ""
"To compare two files by content, you can either:<ul><li>Select one file in "
"the left panel, and one in the right panel.</li><li>Select exactly two files "
"in the active panel.</li><li>Make sure there is a file in the other panel, "
"with the same name as the current file in the active panel.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du twee Dateien na ehr Inholt verglieken wullt, kannst Du<ul><li>een "
"Datei links un een Datei rechts utsöken,</li><li>akraat twee Dateien binnen "
"dat aktive Paneel utsöken oder</li><li>besekern, dat gifft en Datei binnen "
"dat anner Paneel mit akraat den sülven Naam as de aktuelle Datei binnen dat "
"aktive Paneel</li></ul>"

